        "candidate_id": "C_6f386c94321d1464_0",
        "edit": "Fixed the 3'b100 and 3'b111 case literals by adding the missing zero so they are 8-bit values (0001_0000 and 1000_0000) instead of 7-bit values, correcting the one-hot decoder outputs.",
